  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sijonge Kuwe Food Gardening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security is one of the imprtant tool to fight poverty and unemployment in underdeveloped countries in Africa.Sijonge Kuwe has sarted food gardening project in Khayelitsha.Youth,women and people with disabilities are encouraged to have food gardening in their homes and will be trained on food gardening skills as well as business skills training.We intend to train 20 people in this quarter.On completion of training these individuals will be supplied with   small tools,seeds and fertilizer.</narrative>
  </description>
